about to be] ill.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":89,"sd":null},{"k":"37:90","t":"So they turned away from him, departing.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":90,"sd":null},{"k":"37:91","t":"Then he turned to their gods and said, \"Do you not eat?","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":91,"sd":null},{"k":"37:92","t":"What is [wrong] with you that you do not speak?\".","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":92,"sd":null},{"k":"37:93","t":"And he turned upon them a blow with [his] right hand.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":93,"sd":null},{"k":"37:94","t":"Then they [i.e., the people] came toward him, hastening.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":94,"sd":null},{"k":"37:95","t":"He said, \"Do you worship that which you [yourselves] carve,","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":95,"sd":null},{"k":"37:96","t":"While Allāh created you and that which you do?\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":96,"sd":null},{"k":"37:97","t":"They said, \"Construct for him a structure [i.e., furnace] and throw him into the burning fire.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":97,"sd":null},{"k":"37:98","t":"And they intended for him a plan [i.e., harm], but We made them the most debased.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":98,"sd":null},{"k":"37:99","t":"And [then] he said, \"Indeed, I will go to [where I am ordered by] my Lord; He will guide me.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":99,"sd":null},{"k":"37:100","t":"My Lord, grant me [a child] from among the righteous.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":100,"sd":null},{"k":"37:101","t":"So We gave him good tidings of a forbearing boy.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":101,"sd":null},{"k":"37:102","t":"And when he reached with him [the age of] exertion, he said, \"O my son, indeed I have seen in a dream that I [must] sacrifice you, so see what you think.\" He said, \"O my father, do as you are commanded. You will find me, if Allāh wills, of the steadfast.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":102,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":45,"surahs":[37],"sajdah":false}